    "live effect preview":"Approximate real-time preview of particles and renderers using current CFX data, CASC/local textures, runtime inputs, atlas settings, and procedural modulation.",
    "native pkb decoder":"Directly decodes the Warcraft effect bake container into class records, layers, samplers, renderers, events, curves, shapes, and compiled VM scripts. This view is structural and read-only; it does not require Curve Discovery to recognize structures already covered by the native decoder.",
