    "structural session":"Keeps multiple new branches as virtual drafts, then compiles all of them into one deterministic multi-array transaction and one final PKB.",
    "pkb inspector / round-trip":"Shows dependencies, structure, byte coverage, and exact round-trip checks. Use it to prove that untouched bytes rebuild identically.",
    "pkb corpus / structured decoder":"Research workspace for comparing many PKBs, clustering evidence, correlating fields, and building the confirmed structure registry.",
