    "native pkb write plan / graph subtree bridge":"Maps native graph nodes onto confirmed PKB templates and stages the writes/pointers required to materialize a graph subtree.",
    "native pkb incremental compiler":"Analyzes changes to already-bound native graph subtrees and builds only safe incremental PKB plans; unsafe replacement remains blocked.",
    "warcraft preflight / performance":"Checks Warcraft-facing compatibility, missing dependencies, particle/draw complexity, and the selected performance budget before export.",
    "corn manager":"Edits ParticleEmitterPopcorn objects from the model currently open in Model Lab, including the referenced PKB path and preview-related parameters.",
    "math / path baker":"Samples procedural motion, init shapes, color, or shape equations into native editable curve data and simplifies the result by tolerance.",
    "atlas editor":"Configures a spritesheet grid, valid frame count, FPS, playback mode, and padding, and previews which cell is displayed over time.",
    "color modulation":"Procedurally changes renderer RGBA over time using presets, crossfades, steps, or custom math expressions.",
    "render shape equation":"Defines a 2D procedural mask/outline by sampling X(theta) and Y(theta) equations across a configurable domain.",
    "project trigger":"High-level event and target settings used by the generated project trigger/script.",
    "selected layer":"Timing and relationship settings for the currently selected layer.",
    "selected object":"Resource, type, scale, lifetime, and animation settings for the currently selected object inside the active layer.",
    "layers":"Number of layer blocks currently present in the imported/native effect project.",
    "attributes":"Number of exposed attributes in the current CFX/native project model.",
    "mapped fields":"Count of semantic PKB fields with confirmed or usable mappings available to the Real Effect Editor.",
    "semantic records":"Count of decoded higher-level PKB records assembled from confirmed field mappings.",
    "textures":"Number of texture dependencies detected in the current PKB/renderer context.",
